  uh unless people feel comfortable that  when they go  shopping and they go to a casino  whatever they're not going to get sick  so we need to get a handle on covert 19  and obviously  trump has not done that i mean literally  probably today he's holding rallies  where people are going to be in close  proximity to each other they're not  wearing masks they're actually spreading  the virus  that is not what you want from a  president of the united states but above  and beyond  covert 19 i think if you look at what  biden is talking about  number one uh literally on the  first day of a new congress  if the democrats gain control over the  senate we're going to go  forward on an emergency and very strong  covert 19 uh relief package  to protect the unemployed workers of  this country  who today are struggling to put food on  the table  to get health care to literally pay  their rent and not get evicted  that is priority number one and i know  unemployment is much much too high  in nevada today number two under a joe  biden administration we're going to  raise that minimum wage  to 15 bucks an hour we're going to have  equal pay for equal work  so that latino women and and  african-american women are not making  you know 60 cents on the dollar compared  to men uh  we are going to have paid family and  medical leave  we are going to have universal child  care so i think if you  look at the economic agenda of biden it  is a destroy it is a strong agenda  which will protect working families in  nevada and around the country  uh you you won the nevada caucus way  back in february um you're now obviously  supporting joe biden  when it comes to you know if he wins the  election how will you work with him to  ensure that some of  your progressive ideals actually make it  into his administration his white house  well you know i i think as nevada  indicated  uh but not just nevada we won iowa we're  in new hampshire we won a number of  other states  the progressive movement now